I waited until 9:50. [l]To fulfil my promise with the guys, I head down to my room to change into my exercising clothes. [l]I take the time I have left to gaze down the window in my room. [p]

[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]

