[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]
I take the time to breathe. [l]This still feels unreal. [l]Barely twenty four hours ago, I was still down there, on earth. [l]And now I’m gazing right at it from above. [l]It feels really empowering. [l]I’ve done nothing but study and work to stand where I am right now. [p]Seeing this pitch black universe with my own eyes, and not from a manual. [l]Seeing the planet I was born on, so far away from me. [l]I can’t help but miss it, but this is something I decided to do on my own. [l]To think about going back... [l]I need to fight this urge. [l]At least for my own sake. [p]

[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
[bg storage=Backgrounds/bg02_corridor_C.png method=crossfade time=1000 wait=false]
[fadeoutbgm time=3000]
[current layer="message1"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]

[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]
Alright, I think it’s time to go. [l]Klaus didn’t give us a precise rendezvous point, so I simply decided to walk along the corridor. [l]It was quite long, not that spacious, but the architecture made it appear larger than it actually was. [l] if it wasn’t for the very wide window nearby, acting as a pinpoint for marking out the different components of the floor. [l]

[playse storage=SoundEffects_Action/footsteps.ogg loop=false clear=false layer=1]
I could hear some footsteps coming closer and closer. [p]
[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
