[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]

Since the structure of the station is circular, it was just like running down an infinite road. [l]Klaus was a bit ahead of us, and Joshua was following behind me. [l]So as to not waste our breath, we pretty much stayed silent. [l]But doing some exercise after spending so much time in the space shuttle was quite refreshing. [p]
The dim light of the corridors let me the see the full scope of the black space outside. [l]Everytime we ran near a window, I couldn’t resist simply gazing towards the stars, even if it was for a mere few seconds. [l]I must have looked quite silly in Joshua’s eyes. [l]

[bg storage=black.png method=crossfade time=1000 wait=false]
I simply ran, ran, and ran... [l]With Klaus always ahead, and still silent. [l]Once again, we pass another window. [l]And again, I turn my head towards-[p]

