Ugh, you guys just abandoned me and didn’t even realize I was dying behind you... [p]
#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#cc66ff">Klaus</font>
Why didn’t you speak up? [p]
[chara_mod name="Joshua" storage="/chara/3/joshua_surprised.png" time=200 cross=false]
#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#ffcc33">Joshua</font>
I did! [l]But you guys just didn’t care and kept running while I was running out of stamina! [p]
[image storage=default/EuphieSpritesJogging/euphie_jogging_embarassed.png layer=2 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
