We enter the cafeteria. [l]We’re greeted by Klaus and Alexeï, already sitting at the same table as this morning. [l][r][r]They seemed to be silent, but considering their personalities, I’m not surprised at all. [l]I can’t quite imagine a conversation between the two of them. [l][r][r]Talk about a way to set the mood... [p]

