After getting my food with Joshua and Nico, we all sit down together. [l]At least I managed to find a way to bring the group together this morning. [l][r][r]Now, it’ll all be about communication... [l]Let’s try to break up the silence, first. [p]

[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=true]
[image storage=default/UI_Elements/stellar_ui_chat2big.png layer=1 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
