Oh, wow! [l]That's handy! [p]
[freeimage layer=2]
[freeimage layer=1]
[current layer="message1"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]

#<font face="earthorbiter"></font>
Using the map was as simple as it could possibly be. [l]Even a kid slightly used to checking an online map out could easily learn how to use it. [l]It's not a simple drawing, but an entirely 3D modeled map. [l]It also displays which floor you're currently on. [l]
[playse storage=SoundEffects_Action/vibrate.ogg loop=false clear=false layer=1]
Suddenly, the watch vibrates. [p]

[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
