#<font face="earthorbiter"></font>
The screen was displaying a photo of Nicola, just like if I was receiving a call from her from any normal phone. [l]I press the green button to answer it, even though she's right in front of me. [l]I try and speak in direction of the microphone. [p]

[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
