[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]

#<font face="earthorbiter"></font>
My voice echoes in the speakers of Nicola's watch. [l]On my screen, I could see two icons flickering on the side. [l]One was lit up in blue, displaying an internet logo. [l]The other one was grey, displaying a similar image. [l]The sound wasn't too bad in quality, most likely because it’s using the station’s internet network as a source of communication. [l]Curious, I look at Nicola's watch. [l]I could see my own photo on her screen. [p]

[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=true]
[image storage=default/UI_Elements/stellar_ui_chat2big.png layer=1 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
[image storage=default/EuphieSprites/euphie_normal_speak.png layer=2 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#ff8080">Euphie</font>
It even has my picture! [p]

[freeimage layer=2]
[freeimage layer=1]
[current layer="message1"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[chara_mod name="Nicola" storage="/chara/5/nicola_smile.png" time=200 cross=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]

#<font face="earthorbiter"></font>
I exclaimed over her watch, which ends up echoing louder and louder, since our microphones and speakers were close. [l]Nicola immediately hung up, to spare our ears from the feedback's cacophony. [l]My watch's screen went back to the home menu. [p]

